{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32162","headline":"春愁曲 · 温庭筠","name":"春愁曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"红丝穿露珠帘冷，百尺哑哑下纤绠。\n远翠愁山入卧屏，两重云母空烘影。\n凉簪坠发春眠重，玉兔煴香柳如梦。\n锦叠空牀委堕红，颸颸扫尾双金凤。\n蜂喧蝶驻俱悠扬，柳拂赤栏纤草长。\n觉後梨花委平绿，春风和雨吹池塘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32162.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32162","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}